  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ce moment, les fans de Pitrouille sont en émoi\nà cause d’une découverte inattendue.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle est cette découverte ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C006500200065007300740020006300650074007400650020006400E90063006F0075007600650072007400650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi un tel émoi ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F006900200075006E002000740065006C002000E9006D006F00690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avant, on classifiait les Pitrouille en fonction de\nleur taille selon les catégories suivantes : Taille<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMini, Taille Normale, Taille Maxi et Taille Ultra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sauf que !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610075006600200071007500650020002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il ne s’agit pas seulement d’une différence\nde taille ! C’est plus subtil que ça !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pitrouille sont désormais classés en quatre\nvariations : petite, moyenne, grande et giga.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfin, je dis « variations », mais je devrais plutôt\nparler de « variétés »...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, j’ai décidé d’en savoir plus en capturant\ndes Pitrouille de toutes les variétés.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai bien avancé, mais il me manque encore\nun spécimen de Variété Giga.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On peut en trouver la nuit, dans la zone\nsauvage nº 15.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020007000650075007400200065006E002000740072006F00750076006500720020006C00610020006E007500690074002C002000640061006E00730020006C00610020007A006F006E0065000A00730061007500760061006700650020006E00BA002000310035002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À vrai dire, ça m’aiderait beaucoup que\ntu m’en apportes un !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C00020007600720061006900200064006900720065002C002000E700610020006D201900610069006400650072006100690074002000620065006100750063006F007500700020007100750065000A007400750020006D20190065006E0020006100700070006F007200740065007300200075006E0020002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour te donner une idée, les Pitrouille de Variété\nGiga sont encore plus grands que ceux-là !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, ne m’apporte pas de Pokémon Baron :\nceux-là sont hors concours !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu m’as apporté un Pitrouille de Variété Giga ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006D2019006100730020006100700070006F0072007400E900200075006E00200050006900740072006F00750069006C006C00650020006400650020005600610072006900E9007400E9002000470069006700610020003F00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, non...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002C0020006E006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai giga hâte que tu me le donnes !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069002000670069006700610020006800E20074006500200071007500650020007400750020006D00650020006C006500200064006F006E006E006500730020002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aurais vraiment besoin d’un Pitrouille\nde Variété Giga.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOn en trouve dans la zone sauvage nº 15 une fois\nla nuit tombée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais, c’est un Pitrouille Baron de Variété Giga ?!\nMerci, mais ce n’est pas ce que j’avais demandé !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe ne préfère même pas savoir combien d’âmes\nun Pitrouille de cette taille emmène vers l’au-delà.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 206
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai giga besoin d’un Pitrouille de Variété Giga !\nPar contre, pas de Baron, s’il te plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Un Pitrouille de Variété Giga !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200055006E00200050006900740072006F00750069006C006C00650020006400650020005600610072006900E9007400E9002000470069006700610020002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Celui-ci semble pouvoir emmener des âmes\nde taille gigantesque vers l’au-delà ! Fascinant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ils ont beau se ressembler, je vois maintenant\npourquoi on parle de variétés !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahem... Je ne suis pas sûre de tout comprendre,\nmais la taille de celui-ci m’a convaincue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon objectif, à présent, c’est que mon âme soit\nassez grande pour nécessiter une Variété Giga !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment de m’avoir apporté le spécimen\nde Pitrouille que je cherchais !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes quatre variétés de Pitrouille peuvent\nemmener des âmes de toute taille vers l’au-delà.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSi tu en as besoin, je te les prête quand tu veux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
